      "id": "in_278",
      "title": "Add on same-direction CZ breaks while in a CZX trade",
      "value": false,
      "why": "PYRX - add on same-direction CZ breaks. Found ON against a default of false. Off is the source default and the recorded intent. With it on, TradingView pairs stacked exits FIFO, so per-row attribution inside a stack is TradingView's construct - which is exactly what a top-three-winners statistic measures."
    },
